From d6f73eabca63966822bcfec7da98ad6dbe6dcdeb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kstep <kstep@localhost>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 09:08:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tcg: add wasm64 JIT backend for Emscripten hosts

Kohei Tokunaga's 33-patch series 'wasm: Add Wasm TCG backend based on
wasm64' (github.com/ktock/qemu, branch wasm64-tcg-b, 2026-01-14) rebased
onto v11.1.0. Changes needed for the rebase: drop MAINTAINERS hunks, two
ifdef context fixes (tcg/tcg.c, include/accel/tcg/getpc.h), re-add the
wasm64_32bit_address_limit meson option and its configure wiring, and stub
the smax/smin/umax/umin/revbit8/32/64 ops added upstream since as
C_NotImplemented.
---
